        "source_locator": {
          "kind": "source-unlabelled-speech",
          "ordinal": 6,
          "description": "Source block 6: ஜமீன்தார் ஜம்புலிங்க பூபதி அவர்கள், தன் அருமை மகள் உமாவை எனக்கு வாழ்க்கைத் துணைவியாக்க சம்மதித்ததற்காக முதலில் என் நன்றியைத் தெரிவித்துக்கொள"
        },
        "speaker_label": null,
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-unlabelled",
        "source_delimiter": null,
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 56,
            "printed_page": 55
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source prints no speaker label for this spoken unit; no speaker or immutable dialogue ID is inferred."
        ],
        "english_text": "First, I thank Zamindar Jambuling Bhoopathi for consenting to make his dear daughter Uma my life-partner!... But now I am going to reveal a startling secret!.. Even after that, is the zamindar prepared to accept me as his son-in-law?... I need an answer to this question!"
      }
    },
