        "speaker_label_origin": "source-explicit",
        "source_delimiter": ":—",
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 56,
            "printed_page": 55
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "First I need an answer to my question!... What is this great secret... a Chidambaram secret?...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`சிதம்பர ரகசியம்` is retained as the culturally specific “Chidambaram secret,” a conventional expression for a great/hidden mystery."
        ]
