      "translation": {
        "english_text": "For the townspeople to bow, for the world to praise, for the flag of the estate family's honour to fly in shining splendour; ten men standing with folded hands... hundreds more serving at their feet!.. With such pomp, distinction, grand living and proud prestige, I—the man about to tie the thaali around the daughter of the illustrious Jambuling Bhoopathi—am merely the son of an ordinary coachman!...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
