        "notes": [
          "The source prints no speaker label for this spoken unit; no speaker or immutable dialogue ID is inferred."
        ],
        "english_text": "(Going to Sadaiyan, pulling him forward) This is my father!... A poor man who drives a carriage on this estate!... Fifteen years ago... I left my loving mother and father and ran away somewhere... somehow studied and earned a degree... and returned here to work, saying, “I too am a human being—I too have a goal.” Vingan... my old name is Sokkalingam!"
      }
