      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I am alive, Appa!... I am still alive to teach some of the beasts who are still alive a lesson!... (looking at the zamindar) Now tell me—the son of Sadaiyan and the daughter of the zamindar are to marry! You consent, don't you, Zamindar sir?",
