      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I already knew who Vingan was...! Perhaps you do not know how deeply the feelings of equality and social justice are soaked into my blood... Zamindarism and social-justice-ism together make this Jambuling-Bhoopathi-ism!... A zamindar's daughter too is born after ten months! A coachman's son too is born after ten months! God did not create a difference where the estate girl has red blood and the coachman's son black blood!... Their hearts have mingled—joined! My egalitarian heart has blossomed with happiness!.. Vingan!.. There is no need to hesitate—there is no obstacle!.. Tie the thaali around the neck of the only daughter I have!... Hmm... come, bridegroom!...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source deliberately coins the comic political blend `ஜமீன்தாரிசம்—சமதர்ம இசம் ... ஜம்புலிங்கபூபதி இசம்`; English preserves the invented “-ism” construction."
        ]
      }
    },
